· colo spend is estimated
  priced from current inventory at list rates. No billing API; runs low for anything deleted mid-period, and excludes credits, tax and refunds

· EUR converted to USD at 1.08 from 2026-10-01 (your rate); 1.07–1.09 (ECB reference rates, 2026-11-01 to 2026-11-02)
· GBP converted to USD at 1.27 (ECB reference rate, 2026-11-01)
· CHF converted to USD at 1.1 from 2026-09-01 (your rate)
  a rate your organization stated always wins over an automatic ECB rate; weekends and holidays carry the last ECB publication; spend already in USD is not converted
! JPY not included in the USD figure
  no stated or automatic rate covers every day in this range (the ECB does not publish every currency), so these amounts are listed separately in their own currency rather than folded in or dropped

