2026-10 ························ no verdicts  0 of 0 reviewed · 0 unexpected · 0 suppressed
2026-11 ████████████████████████ 100%  2 of 2 reviewed · 2 unexpected · 0 suppressed

overall 60%  5 of 7 reviewed · 2 expected · 3 unexpected · 1 suppressed

